OL,3,GNEWSAWarning over fraudsters posing as
OL,4,Abank fraud team
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are warning islanders of
OL,7,Ffraudsters posing as a bank in a bid to
OL,8,Fget private account information.
OL,10,FGuernsey Police said WhatsApp messages
OL,11,Fhave been sent from people pretending
OL,12,Fto be members of a Lloyds Bank fraud
OL,13,Fteam.
OL,15,FThe messages use the bank's logo and
OL,16,Fask recipients to help them with an
OL,17,Finvestigation into fraud.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
