OL,3,GNEWSAWarning over fraudsters posing as
OL,4,Abank fraud team
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police spokesperson said: "If there
OL,7,Fis any doubt in your mind as to whether
OL,8,Fthe person contacting you is real, cut
OL,9,Fcommunication, and contact your bank
OL,10,Fvia other means, such as using a phone
OL,11,Fnumber on your bank statement."
